{"card":{"card_id":"ma-c-210e81046ff97efe7224","statement":"K_\\alpha^{\\sigma^{(\\vep)}(\\alpha)}\n=x^{2\\delta_{i,0}}K_{\\alpha+\\eb_i-\\eb_{i+1}}^{\\sigma^{(\\vep)}(\\alpha+\\eb_i-\\eb_{i+1})}.","source_id":"arXiv:2012.00967","cluster":"mathematics","statement_sha256":"40f261e07a9fc1826aafb777a2173e9b13b2a73448450c4bc9717a8823b4c86a","kind":"equation","label":"Equation (a)","ref_key":"(a)","name":"","order":9,"deps":[],"cite_keys":[],"provenance":{"source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2012.00967","harvest_mode":"arxiv_eprint","payload_sha256":"d1adc339d796c1ac2f8b9eb47b789e0355426463b407ef73101192b096da360b","line":413,"origin":"latex_env:equation","retrieved_at":"2026-09-26T14:00:38+08:00"},"wash":{"version":"cardwash.v2","stages":["segment","purify","classify","dedupe","emit"],"numbering":"document_order_with_label_heuristic","detail":{"stripped_proof":false,"chars":122,"math_hints":23}}},"paper":{"source_id":"arXiv:2012.00967","title":"Solution to the reflection equation related to the $\\iota$quantum group of type AII","abstract":"A solution to the reflection equation associated to a coideal subalgebra of $U_q(A_{2n-1}^{(1)})$ of type AII in the symmetric tensor representations is presented. If parameters of the coideal subalgebra are suitably chosen, the $K$ matrix does not depend on the quantum parameter $q$ and still agrees with a solution in arXiv:nlin/0411044 at $q=0$.","authors":["Hiroto Kusano","Masato Okado"],"year":"2020","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2012.00967","cluster":"mathematics","macros":{"Q":"{\\mathbb Q}","Z":"{\\mathbb Z}","eb":"\\boldsymbol{e}","jb":"\\boldsymbol{j}","lb":"\\boldsymbol{l}","mb":"\\boldsymbol{m}","ob":"\\boldsymbol{o}","ot":"\\otimes","pair":"\\langle{#1}\\rangle","U":"\\mathbf{U}","vep":"\\varepsilon","wb":"\\boldsymbol{w}"},"macros_override":[]},"deps":[],"dependents":[]}